<?php /* Template Name: FAQ */ get_header(); $faqs=[['Is discovery free for new clients?','Yes. Free discovery is available for every new client. We discuss your goals and requirements at no charge, then agree scope, estimated hours and deadlines before paid work begins.'],['How much will my project cost?','Our typical rate for agreed project work is £20/hour. We discuss scope and estimated hours before paid work begins.'],['Can you help choose between Shopify and WooCommerce?','We can review your catalogue, integrations, editing needs and maintenance arrangements. Hosting, subscriptions and extensions should be considered alongside development costs.'],['Can you guarantee search rankings or AI citations?','No. Search engines and AI tools select which pages to surface. We focus on useful content and technical foundations without promising a particular result.'],['Can you improve an existing website or store?','Yes. Share the current setup and the problems you want to solve. We can discuss design, content, search or technical improvements within an agreed scope.'],['Do you work with businesses outside the UK?','We can discuss remote projects with businesses in different locations. Delivery arrangements and location-specific requirements should be agreed before work starts.'],['Can you help with eBay account management?','We support individual and business eBay accounts with listings, store organisation, order workflows and buyer communication within an agreed scope.'],['Can you guarantee marketplace sales?','No. Sales depend on demand, pricing, products, fulfilment and marketplace behaviour. We focus on accurate information and clear product presentation.']]; ?><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Before we begin</p><h1>Good questions. Clear answers.</h1><p class="muted">A few things you may want to know before discussing your project.</p></header><div class="faq-list"><?php foreach($faqs as $faq): ?><details><summary><?php echo esc_html($faq[0]); ?></summary><p><?php echo esc_html($faq[1]); ?></p></details><?php endforeach; ?></div></div></section><?php get_footer(); ?>
